sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant Helm as Helm / Kustomize
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>(OpenShift only)
    participant Operators as Dependency Operators
    participant RHAI as RHAI Operator
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant Gateway as Istio Gateway
    participant Authorino as Authorino<br/>(rhcl-operator)
    participant Client as External Client

    rect rgb(230, 243, 255)
        Note over Admin,Operators: Deployment Phase (XKS or OpenShift)
        Admin->>Helm: helm install / kustomize apply
        alt XKS Path (Non-OLM)
            Helm->>Operators: Deploy sub-charts<br/>(sail-operator, cert-manager,<br/>gateway-api, rhcl-operator, lws-operator)
        else OpenShift Path (OLM)
            Helm->>OLM: Create Subscriptions<br/>(cert-manager, kueue, observability,<br/>opentelemetry, lws, job-set, tempo, cma, rhcl)
            OLM->>Operators: Install operators from catalog
        end
        Helm->>RHAI: Deploy RHAI Operator
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over RHAI,Authorino: Post-Install Configuration Phase
        RHAI->>CertMgr: Request TLS certificates<br/>(rhai-ca-issuer ClusterIssuer)
        CertMgr-->>RHAI: Issue certificates
        RHAI->>Gateway: Create KServe Inference Gateway<br/>(TLS enabled, Same namespace routes)
        RHAI->>Authorino: Configure TLS-enabled listener<br/>(authorino-server-cert)
        RHAI->>Gateway: Create MaaS Gateway (optional)<br/>(TLS, configurable namespace routes)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Client,Authorino: Runtime Data Flow (configured by odh-gitops)
        Client->>Gateway: HTTPS request<br/>(TLS 1.2+)
        Gateway->>Authorino: Authorization check<br/>(TLS client cert)
        Authorino-->>Gateway: Policy decision
        Gateway->>RHAI: Route to KServe<br/>Inference Service
        RHAI-->>Gateway: Inference response
        Gateway-->>Client: HTTPS response
    end
